{"1248550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breaking Gates", "steam_appid": 1248550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/1f30ac0e377630349f0ddd19ad93295f.poster.avif?t=1771096130\" width=616 height=277 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/1f30ac0e377630349f0ddd19ad93295f.webm?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaking Gates</strong> is a <strong>2D action RPG</strong> where <strong>every move matters</strong>. Build devastating combos, explore vibrant handcrafted environments, and challenge formidable bosses in a world on the edge of collapse. Here, <strong>skill shapes your destiny</strong>.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/c2fa7dbce63323ddebadf4cdcd83015f.poster.avif?t=1771096130\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/c2fa7dbce63323ddebadf4cdcd83015f.webm?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/c2fa7dbce63323ddebadf4cdcd83015f.mp4?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your disposal are powerful skills and abilities that allow you to chain together devastating combos, perform aerial attacks, and unleash powerful super moves. Fight your way through the world by defeating fearsome enemies, upgrading your arsenal, and mastering a variety of combat techniques. As you delve deeper into the world, you’ll discover hidden treasures, unlock secret passages, and face imposing bosses in battles that will test your reflexes and strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/3a1eb3d8562e70692ace081cebb2d0a0.poster.avif?t=1771096130\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/3a1eb3d8562e70692ace081cebb2d0a0.webm?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/3a1eb3d8562e70692ace081cebb2d0a0.mp4?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/e4a70121c7e153b4f19c80ba4f84ab35.poster.avif?t=1771096130\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/e4a70121c7e153b4f19c80ba4f84ab35.webm?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/e4a70121c7e153b4f19c80ba4f84ab35.mp4?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hand-Drawn Adventure:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted world filled with vibrant, hand-drawn animations and a colorful art style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Combat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a combat system that’s easy to learn, yet challenging to master. Chain together combos, perform aerial maneuvers, and unleash spectacular special moves to dominate your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Boss Fights:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge imposing foes in battles that require quick reflexes, strategic thinking, and sharp skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration and Discovery:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a sprawling world filled with hidden secrets, rare treasures, and ancient mysteries waiting to be uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization and Crafting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to forge powerful new gear, enhance your abilities, and shape your hero’s fighting style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tale of Adventure:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fun-filled story filled with danger and discovery as you fight to protect the kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exclusive Soundtrack:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a captivating original soundtrack designed to amplify the thrill and excitement of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking Gates combines the intensity of action-RPG combat with the charm of classic 2D platformers, delivering a rich experience for fans of exploration, strategy, and adrenaline-pumping battles. Are you ready to break through the gates and save the kingdom?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/1f30ac0e377630349f0ddd19ad93295f.poster.avif?t=1771096130\" width=616 height=277 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/1f30ac0e377630349f0ddd19ad93295f.webm?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaking Gates</strong> is a <strong>2D action RPG</strong> where <strong>every move matters</strong>. Build devastating combos, explore vibrant handcrafted environments, and challenge formidable bosses in a world on the edge of collapse. Here, <strong>skill shapes your destiny</strong>.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/c2fa7dbce63323ddebadf4cdcd83015f.poster.avif?t=1771096130\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/c2fa7dbce63323ddebadf4cdcd83015f.webm?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/c2fa7dbce63323ddebadf4cdcd83015f.mp4?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your disposal are powerful skills and abilities that allow you to chain together devastating combos, perform aerial attacks, and unleash powerful super moves. Fight your way through the world by defeating fearsome enemies, upgrading your arsenal, and mastering a variety of combat techniques. As you delve deeper into the world, you’ll discover hidden treasures, unlock secret passages, and face imposing bosses in battles that will test your reflexes and strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/3a1eb3d8562e70692ace081cebb2d0a0.poster.avif?t=1771096130\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/3a1eb3d8562e70692ace081cebb2d0a0.webm?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/3a1eb3d8562e70692ace081cebb2d0a0.mp4?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/e4a70121c7e153b4f19c80ba4f84ab35.poster.avif?t=1771096130\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/e4a70121c7e153b4f19c80ba4f84ab35.webm?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1248550/extras/e4a70121c7e153b4f19c80ba4f84ab35.mp4?t=1771096130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hand-Drawn Adventure:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted world filled with vibrant, hand-drawn animations and a colorful art style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Combat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a combat system that’s easy to learn, yet challenging to master. Chain together combos, perform aerial maneuvers, and unleash spectacular special moves to dominate your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Boss Fights:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge imposing foes in battles that require quick reflexes, strategic thinking, and sharp skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration and Discovery:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a sprawling world filled with hidden secrets, rare treasures, and ancient mysteries waiting to be uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization and Crafting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to forge powerful new gear, enhance your abilities, and shape your hero’s fighting style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tale of Adventure:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fun-filled story filled with danger and discovery as you fight to protect the kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exclusive Soundtrack:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a captivating original soundtrack designed to amplify the thrill and excitement of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking Gates combines the intensity of action-RPG combat with the charm of classic 2D platformers, delivering a rich experience for fans of explorat